{
  "mn12:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 12 ",
  "mn12:0.2": "Mahāsīhanādasutta ",
  "mn12:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn12:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā vesāliyaṁ viharati bahinagare aparapure vanasaṇḍe. ",
  "mn12:2.1": "Tena kho pana samayena sunakkhatto licchaviputto acirapakkanto hoti imasmā dhammavinayā. ",
  "mn12:2.2": "So vesāliyaṁ parisati evaṁ vācaṁ bhāsati: ",
  "mn12:2.3": "“natthi samaṇassa gotamassa uttari manussadhammā alamariyañāṇadassanaviseso. ",
  "mn12:2.4": "Takkapariyāhataṁ samaṇo gotamo dhammaṁ deseti vīmaṁsānucaritaṁ sayampaṭibhānaṁ. ",
  "mn12:2.5": "Yassa ca khvāssa atthāya dhammo desito so niyyāti takkarassa sammā dukkhakkhayāyā”ti. ",
  "mn12:3.1": "Atha kho āyasmā sāriputto pubbaṇhasamayaṁ nivāsetvā pattacīvaramādāya vesāliṁ piṇḍāya pāvisi. ",
  "mn12:3.2": "Assosi kho āyasmā sāriputto sunakkhattassa licchaviputtassa vesāliyaṁ parisati evaṁ vācaṁ bhāsamānassa: ",
  "mn12:3.3": "“natthi samaṇassa gotamassa uttari manussadhammā alamariyañāṇadassanaviseso. ",
  "mn12:3.4": "Takkapariyāhataṁ samaṇo gotamo dhammaṁ deseti vīmaṁsānucaritaṁ sayampaṭibhānaṁ. ",
  "mn12:3.5": "Yassa ca khvāssa atthāya dhammo desito so niyyāti takkarassa sammā dukkhakkhayāyā”ti. ",
  "mn12:3.6": "Atha kho āyasmā sāriputto vesāliyaṁ piṇḍāya caritvā pacchābhattaṁ piṇḍapātapaṭikkanto yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamanta